{"id":"vod_sn_36095","vodId":"36095","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"嘟嘟猫观察日记","name_cn":"嘟嘟猫观察日记","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1582d76bc105052e1e7c92eb31b72faa.jpg"},"summary":"本片以架空的田园都市千叶县的竹马市为舞台，讲述了一名叫佐藤萌（三森铃子 配音）的女性和她的猫咪“噗哟”之间的温馨日常故事。与噗哟的相遇被佐藤萌称为“命运的邂逅”，自此噗哟便和佐藤萌一家生活在一起。噗哟（大谷育江 配音），是一只黄毛虎纹小猫，它有着近似球形的外表，深受大家喜爱。在同一屋檐下生活，噗哟和大家会发生怎么样的有趣故事呢？　　本动画改编自日本漫画家树露的四格漫画。而为主人公噗哟担任声优的是大谷育江，她曾饰演过日本的国民级吉祥物皮卡丘，以及《海贼王》中超级可爱的乔巴。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ksGkrGgwSn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ERkgPDfnMr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gxi33WMBU41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QrSs3Xx0Eq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MPi3RD8BvZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fdDXiuebTx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xBE882wH5d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pt8T1du0ZW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FY62ahcfpv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gTrZ0wKkqS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kudwJvP5fS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nxu0CpjqCB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AwHwz7K0011/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EzUeTMXed51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Twp6Z